  "title": "Toon shading in bands with a rim light",
  "purpose": "Cel-shade a lit mesh in a chosen number of flat light bands with tinted shadows and add a view-dependent rim that is stronger on the lit side. Use for stylized characters, props and toy-like scenes.",
